{"id": "EUVD-2026-97001", "enisaUuid": "ff110eb1-df57-3010-a464-169ac5834900", "description": "Company Research Agent through 2.2.0 contains a server-side request forgery vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to trigger outbound requests by injecting unescaped ReportLab paragraph markup into the /generate-pdf endpoint. Attackers can embed inline img elements in report_content to make the server fetch internal or external hosts, leaking image responses in returned PDFs and probing reachability.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T13:26:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:44:46", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/guy-hartstein-company-research-agent-pdf-ssrf", "https://github.com/guy-hartstein/company-research-agent/blob/v2.2.0/backend/utils/utils.py#L196", "https://github.com/guy-hartstein/company-research-agent/blob/v2.2.0/application.py#L264-L265", "https://github.com/guy-hartstein/company-research-agent", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/company-research-agent-through-2.2.0-ssrf-via-generate-pdf-reportlab-markup"], "aliases": ["GHSA-5j4m-qx6m-86qc", "CVE-2026-108850"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "85164bfa-ddac-3ff6-a399-cb439bc97593", "product": {"name": "company-research-agent", "vendor": {"name": "guy-hartstein"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.2.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5f7da49b-c419-3999-ab48-e0668eeb39fd", "vendor": {"name": "guy-hartstein"}}], "isExploited": false}